            "review_title": "Review at Tantan Noodles Kitchen Vietnam",
            "review_text": "Geunhuilee\nSeoul, South Korea5 contributions\n0\nThe famous noodle restaurant from Korea was really POINT.\nAug 2023 • Business\nIf you like noodles, you should try the most popular Tantan noodles at Lotte Mall. Both men and women of all ages liked it and there were various menus. I heard that side menu gyoza and chicken are handmade, so it was very delicious. The number one must-see place if you go to Lotte Mall.\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten August 23, 2023",
